2
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:04,500
堕天使
[Title: Fallen Angel]

3
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,000
悩める人の子よ
O child of man, lost in worry,

4
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,000
人ならざる者よ
O non-human being,

5
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,500
合間絶えず目指す天よ
O heaven aimed for without fail,

6
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:09,900
生きていけ私
Live on, my self.

7
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,400
目を逸らした過去も
The past I looked away from,

8
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,100
退屈な未来も
and the boring future too—

9
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,000
カウンセリング やれやれ
counseling, good grief.

10
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,300
古今東西 ピースピース
Peace, peace, through all times and places!

11
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:33,800
ねねねね 何だかどうして 戦っているようなそんな気がするの
Hey, hey, hey, hey, why do I feel like I'm fighting somehow?

12
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,800
過去の自分自分自分と思う
I keep thinking, "My past self, my past self, my past self."

13
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,000
とっくに死んでる透明な亡霊と対決
A duel with a transparent ghost long dead,

14
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,100
一対一で言った一言の奥の奥
deep within that single word spoken one-on-one.

15
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:46,000
残念 もう居ないのに あれ そっちが良い愛らしさに
Too bad, even though it's gone now... Huh? To that lovely charm over there,

16
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:49,200
透かされているのは今の自分
it's my present self that's being see-through.

17
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:51,500
ナンセンス 消えないレッテル
Nonsense, an indelible label,

18
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,800
家柄コンプレックス
family background complex,

19
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,800
取り憑かれているみたい
like I'm possessed,

20
00:04:55,800 --> 00:05:01,000
泣きついたまま まだ 離れられない 在りし日の自分
clinging onto and still unable to let go of my former self.

21
00:05:02,848 --> 00:05:04,848
信じ合えない Oh my, Oh my way
We can't believe in each other, oh my, oh my way.

22
00:05:04,848 --> 00:05:09,648
さあ 生きていることとは変わり続けることで
Now, to be alive means to keep changing,

23
00:05:09,648 --> 00:05:13,248
不況に甘んじて満足するなよ
So don't settle for unhappiness and be satisfied!

24
00:05:13,248 --> 00:05:16,648
幸せになろうとしないなんて滑稽だろ
It's ridiculous not even trying to be happy, right?

25
00:05:17,948 --> 00:05:22,448
幾回 幾回 ファンタジー 続きは折れるか 跳ね返るか
How many cycles of fantasy? Will the continuation bend or bounce back?

26
00:05:22,448 --> 00:05:26,448
出会って追ってやっと始まるストーリー
Meeting, chasing, and finally the story begins.

27
00:05:26,448 --> 00:05:29,548
さあ一握だけの命か 儚き Lie PEACE PEACE
Is it a life of just a handful? A fleeting lie, peace peace!

28
00:05:30,448 --> 00:05:33,648
Past, future, can't change the past

29
00:05:33,648 --> 00:05:36,848
Past, future, what about the future?

30
00:05:36,848 --> 00:05:40,248
何がどうして未来になんとなくの
Why is it that regarding the future,

31
00:05:40,248 --> 00:05:43,248
希望なんて抱けないような気がしても
I feel like I can't even hold any vague hope?

32
00:05:43,248 --> 00:05:46,548
随分生きてる既視感とテンプレで食傷
Having lived so long, fed up with deja vu and cliches,

33
00:05:46,548 --> 00:05:49,548
素敵な出来事の気配もない
There's not even a sign of wonderful events happening.

34
00:05:49,548 --> 00:05:53,648
積んだ経験の因果経過が活かされた神話と退屈な進化
A myth where accrued experience yields results, and a boring evolution.

35
00:05:53,648 --> 00:05:56,148
要は刺激が欲しいんだ 飽きちゃった 慣れちゃった
Simply put, I want excitement, I'm bored of it, used to it.

36
00:05:56,148 --> 00:05:58,448
なんて整っていくガイドライン
Look at those neat guidelines being set,

37
00:05:58,448 --> 00:06:00,048
増えるコンプライアンス
Increasing compliance,

38
00:06:00,048 --> 00:06:01,648
塞がれていく選択肢
Options being blocked off,

39
00:06:01,648 --> 00:06:03,348
いつからか
Since when?

40
00:06:03,348 --> 00:06:08,148
でもどれもこれも同じ味がする
Yet all of them taste exactly the same.

41
00:06:08,948 --> 00:06:11,348
信じ合えない Oh my, Oh my way
We can't believe in each other, oh my, oh my way.

42
00:06:11,348 --> 00:06:16,148
さあ いつも言う過去も未来も今に宿んだ
Now, the past and future I always talk about dwell in the present.

43
00:06:16,148 --> 00:06:19,548
生きていることを愚直に果たせよ
Fulfill the act of living honestly!

44
00:06:19,548 --> 00:06:22,048
目指せハッピーエンド
Aim for a happy ending!

45
00:06:22,348 --> 00:06:24,748
信じ合えない お前に言ってるんだ
I'm talking to you, who can't believe in others!

46
00:06:24,748 --> 00:06:29,048
幸せを諦めてしまうなんて人かい？
Are you really someone who just gives up on happiness?

47
00:06:29,048 --> 00:06:32,348
ただ苦しみに慣れて耐えているだけじゃ
Just getting used to suffering and enduring it,

48
00:06:32,348 --> 00:06:36,848
死んでるも同然 しかばねのUNDEAD
Is no different from being dead, a corpse of UNDEAD!

49
00:06:40,448 --> 00:06:43,348
大盤振舞せよ 生きているんだろう？
Go all out! You're alive, aren't you?

50
00:06:43,348 --> 00:06:45,548
不幸に浸るのも
Whether wallowing in misfortune,

51
00:06:45,548 --> 00:06:46,848
幸せになるのも
Or becoming happy,

52
00:06:46,848 --> 00:06:48,448
そう全部全部お前だ
Yes, it's all, all up to you!

53
00:06:48,448 --> 00:06:51,148
古今東西一切合切 最新版 Showcases PEACE PEACE
All times and places, everything altogether, latest showcases, peace peace!

54
00:06:51,548 --> 00:06:54,648
Past, future, can't change the past

55
00:06:54,648 --> 00:06:57,748
Past, future, what about the future?

56
00:06:57,748 --> 00:07:01,348
人なるトコロ 煮詰まれいごと生き抜くの
Where humans gather, push through every dilemma,

57
00:07:01,348 --> 00:07:04,748
だけどモノばかり モノガタリ
Yet it's all just things, a story.

58
00:07:18,548 --> 00:07:23,548
花になって
[Title: Becoming a Flower]

59
00:07:28,248 --> 00:07:32,248
陰にそっと隠れようが良いんじゃない？
Wouldn't it be fine to quietly hide in the shadows?

60
00:07:32,248 --> 00:07:37,548
蕾のような花だってあるんじゃない？
Aren't there flowers that stay like buds, too?

61
00:07:37,548 --> 00:07:42,648
秘密にして守るのが良いんじゃない？
Wouldn't it be fine to keep it a secret and protect it?

62
00:07:42,648 --> 00:07:47,748
誰にも邪魔されず 華麗に咲いている
Blooming gorgeously, undisturbed by anyone.

63
00:07:47,748 --> 00:07:51,248
甘い苦いにハマらない
Not getting trapped in sweet or bitter,

64
00:07:51,248 --> 00:07:53,748
その判断がくだらない
That kind of judgment is foolish.

65
00:07:53,748 --> 00:07:57,648
気に病んで下を向かないでいて
Don't worry and look down.

66
00:07:57,648 --> 00:08:00,748
愛に慣れちゃえない
Unable to get used to love,

67
00:08:00,748 --> 00:08:03,148
無駄に飾らない
Not decorating unnecessarily.

68
00:08:03,148 --> 00:08:05,548
綺麗にされた花瓶も
Neither a prettied-up vase,

69
00:08:05,548 --> 00:08:08,048
肥やしも何もいらない
Nor fertilizer, nor anything is needed.

70
00:08:08,048 --> 00:08:12,048
その姿が美しい
Just as you are, you're beautiful.

71
00:08:12,048 --> 00:08:15,048
花になって
Become a flower,

72
00:08:15,048 --> 00:08:18,548
ほらニヒルに笑って
Look, smile nihilistically.

73
00:08:18,548 --> 00:08:22,248
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
Thrilled by that face, I can't take my eyes off you.

74
00:08:22,248 --> 00:08:25,048
味見して
Taste it,

75
00:08:25,048 --> 00:08:28,548
君の毒は私の薬って
Saying, "Your poison is my medicine,"

76
00:08:28,548 --> 00:08:31,348
包んであげるから
Because I'll wrap it up for you,

77
00:08:31,348 --> 00:08:33,548
笑って
Smile.

78
00:08:38,148 --> 00:08:41,248
ねぇ 会いたい 会いたい
Hey, I want to see you, I want to see you.

79
00:08:41,248 --> 00:08:44,348
その笑顔に会いたい 会いたい
I want to see that smile, I want to see it.

80
00:08:44,348 --> 00:08:47,548
って言えば笑ってくれるかな
If I say that, will you smile for me?

81
00:08:48,348 --> 00:08:52,648
陰から支えるくらいはいいんじゃない？
Isn't it fine at least to support from the shadows?

82
00:08:52,648 --> 00:08:57,248
欲を言えばこの手で咲かせてみせたい
If I'm being greedy, I want to make you bloom with my own hands.

83
00:08:57,248 --> 00:09:00,048
病のように
Like a disease,

84
00:09:00,048 --> 00:09:04,548
心を
My heart...

85
00:09:04,548 --> 00:09:06,048
狂わせ
...driven mad,

86
00:09:06,048 --> 00:09:10,048
枯らしたくないのさ
I don't want to let it wither.

87
00:09:10,348 --> 00:09:14,748
光が届かずとも
Even if the light doesn't reach,

88
00:09:14,748 --> 00:09:19,348
水をあげ続けようから
Shall I keep watering you?

89
00:09:23,348 --> 00:09:26,348
いい加減に気づいて
Realize it already,

90
00:09:26,348 --> 00:09:28,948
君は素敵だって
That you are wonderful!

91
00:09:28,948 --> 00:09:33,248
自惚れてもっとお大事に
Be full of yourself and take better care of yourself.

92
00:09:33,248 --> 00:09:36,148
無自覚なまま
Unconsciously,

93
00:09:36,148 --> 00:09:38,548
愛を蓄えて
Store up love.

94
00:09:38,548 --> 00:09:40,948
綺麗にされた花瓶も
Neither a prettied-up vase,

95
00:09:40,948 --> 00:09:43,348
肥やしも何もいらない
Nor fertilizer, nor anything is needed.

96
00:09:43,348 --> 00:09:47,348
その姿で咲き誇れ
Bloom proudly in that very form!

97
00:09:49,548 --> 00:09:52,448
花になって
Become a flower,

98
00:09:52,448 --> 00:09:55,848
ほらニヒルに笑って
Look, smile nihilistically.

99
00:09:55,848 --> 00:09:59,648
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
Thrilled by that face, I can't take my eyes off you.

100
00:09:59,648 --> 00:10:01,548
味見して
Taste it.

101
00:10:01,323 --> 00:10:02,923
ねえ
Hey,

102
00:10:02,923 --> 00:10:06,323
君の毒は私の薬って
"Your poison is my medicine," you said,

103
00:10:06,323 --> 00:10:09,223
包んだから
so since I embraced it...

104
00:10:09,223 --> 00:10:11,923
楽にして
ease your mind.

105
00:10:11,923 --> 00:10:15,923
君の闇は私の光って
"Your darkness is my light," you said,

106
00:10:15,923 --> 00:10:18,723
愛したから
so since I loved it...

107
00:10:18,723 --> 00:10:20,223
笑って
smile for me.

108
00:10:38,923 --> 00:10:42,223
はーい！皆さんこんかなた〜！
Hi! Everyone, kon-kanata~!

109
00:10:42,223 --> 00:10:47,323
キャッチコピーは握力50キロ！ギュッギュッ！握りつぶしちゃうぞ！ホロライブ4期生、天音かなたです！
My catchphrase is 50kg grip strength! Squeeze squeeze! I'll crush you! I'm Hololive 4th Gen, Amane Kanata!

110
00:10:47,323 --> 00:10:50,723
ということでね、2曲お聴きいただきましたがね、
So then, you've listened to two songs so far!

111
00:10:50,723 --> 00:10:54,023
今回も生誕ライブ始まってまいりました！
My birthday live stream has officially begun!

112
00:10:54,023 --> 00:11:00,523
皆さんぜひね、ハッシュタグを使っていっぱいね、つぶやいてください！ポストしてください！
Everyone, please post lots of tweets using the hashtag! Please post!

113
00:11:00,723 --> 00:11:04,223
ハッシュタグはね、#天音かなた生誕祭 でございます！
The hashtag is #天音かなた生誕祭!

114
00:11:04,223 --> 00:11:06,223
すごいシンプルでしょう？
Super simple, right?

115
00:11:06,223 --> 00:11:11,923
ぜひね、色々つぶやいてもらえたら嬉しいなと思います！そしてこのステージ見てください！
I'd be really happy if you tweet all your thoughts! And look at this stage!

116
00:11:12,523 --> 00:11:18,023
うわぁ、すごーい！これすごいでしょ、めちゃめちゃ綺麗でしょ！
Woah, incredible! Isn't this awesome? It's so pretty!

117
00:11:18,523 --> 00:11:21,723
いや、なぜかと言いますとですね、
Well, as for why...

118
00:11:21,723 --> 00:11:27,223
今回の生誕も実はちょっとストーリーがありまして、皆さんに何度も見て考えてもらいたいなと思うんですが、
This birthday live actually has a bit of a story behind it, which I hope you'll watch over and over and think about...

119
00:11:27,223 --> 00:11:31,723
天使と堕天使が...ま、ちょっとね、堕天使の方が世界を滅ぼしたいらしくて、
An angel and a fallen angel... well, the fallen angel apparently wants to destroy the world,

120
00:11:31,723 --> 00:11:35,723
で、天使が立ちはだかって、行って、みたいな...
and the angel stands in her way, and so on...

121
00:11:35,723 --> 00:11:42,723
で、天使が守る...みたいな、世界を守るで「いや、やるぜ」みたいな、テーマは「戦い」な感じになっておりますので、
So the angel protects... protecting the world like, "Alright, let's do this!" The theme is "battle"...

122
00:11:42,723 --> 00:11:49,223
ぜひそのあたりも意識して、歌でバトル、見てくれたら嬉しいなと思います！
So please keep that in mind and enjoy watching our battle through song!

123
00:11:49,723 --> 00:11:53,723
ふぅ〜言いのこしたことはないかな？
Phew~ Did I leave anything unsaid?

124
00:11:53,723 --> 00:11:57,223
またね、歌っていきますのでよろしくお願いします！お！
I'm going to keep singing, so please stay tuned! Oh?

125
00:11:57,223 --> 00:12:01,723
なんか...空が泣きそうじゃない？あ...
Somehow... doesn't the sky look like it's about to cry? Ah...

126
00:12:01,723 --> 00:12:07,723
それでは皆さん、引き続きライブをお楽しみください！
Alright everyone, please continue to enjoy the live stream!

127
00:12:23,723 --> 00:12:28,223
夢が覚めた 酔いどれ知らず
Waking from a dream, unaware of drunkenness

128
00:12:28,223 --> 00:12:31,223
争いごとは 夜が明けるまで
Conflicts last until the night breaks

129
00:12:31,223 --> 00:12:35,923
くたびれては 酷く見える
Exhausted, looking terrible

130
00:12:35,923 --> 00:12:40,223
一千の声は 声が枯れるまで
A thousand voices, until their voices go hoarse

131
00:12:40,223 --> 00:12:44,923
うっちゃる幸せ ずっと醒めないで
Throwing away happiness, never wake up

132
00:12:44,923 --> 00:12:49,523
あなたの声に 耳を貸すときまで
Until the moment I lend an ear to your voice

133
00:12:49,523 --> 00:12:53,923
屈する態度で 言葉さえなくて
With a submissive attitude, without even words

134
00:12:53,923 --> 00:12:56,723
体を染めて
Staining my body...

135
00:12:56,723 --> 00:12:57,923
そして
And then...

136
00:12:57,923 --> 00:13:01,523
泥々 はられあられ ホウライ そう 悪くないわ
Muddy, pelted with hail, Penglai... yes, it's not so bad

137
00:13:01,523 --> 00:13:05,723
屈する 先まで ミリグラム
Yielding down to the last milligram

138
00:13:05,723 --> 00:13:10,223
酩酊 重ね重ね 存外 そう 悪くないわ
Drunkenness, over and over, surprisingly... yes, it's not so bad

139
00:13:10,223 --> 00:13:15,723
酔いどれ知らずの恋敵 だから
Because we're love rivals who know no drunkenness

140
00:13:23,723 --> 00:13:28,723
ウタの声は 数知らず
Countless singing voices

141
00:13:28,723 --> 00:13:32,923
迷い込んだら そこは君の××
If you wander in, that's your XX

142
00:13:32,923 --> 00:13:36,923
ねぇ見てきれい 白昼夢ロンド
Hey, look how pretty, a daydream rondo

143
00:13:36,923 --> 00:13:41,223
一千を隠して 十を吐くだけ
Hiding a thousand, just spitting out ten

144
00:13:41,223 --> 00:13:45,723
一家の幸せ きっと晴れないで
A family's happiness, surely never clearing up

145
00:13:45,723 --> 00:13:49,923
あなたのそばに 耳を貸すときまで
Until the moment I lend an ear by your side

146
00:13:49,923 --> 00:13:54,523
屈する態度で 言葉さえなくて
With a submissive attitude, without even words

147
00:13:54,523 --> 00:13:56,923
心を染めて
Staining my heart...

148
00:13:56,923 --> 00:13:57,923
それは
That is...

149
00:13:57,923 --> 00:14:01,723
泥々 はられあられ 将来像 悪くないわ
Muddy, pelted with hail, a future vision that's not so bad

150
00:14:01,723 --> 00:14:05,723
屈する 私は 生きている
Yielding, I am alive

151
